  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your Gloaming Gaze becomes more powerful, being able to see every vein and current of magic in a creature. You can use Gloaming Gaze once per hour, and its persistent bleed damage increases to 8 damage. In addition, while under its effects, you gain a +2 status bonus to all Perception checks and skill checks against a creature you can see as you can notice their flow of blood and ether or lack thereof to better direct your efforts or understand them.</span></p>"
